# Keep lockfiles and shared configuration tracked:
# uv.lock, package-lock.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, yarn.lock, bun.lock,
# Cargo.lock, go.mod, go.sum, .python-version, and mise.toml.
# Commit Go vendor/ or go.work when they are part of the shared build.
